#: src/tabs/about.cpp:66
msgid "Lovingly referred to as the Swiss Army Knife of PC gaming, Special K does a bit of everything. It is best known for fixing and enhancing graphics, its many detailed performance analysis and correction mods, and a constantly growing palette of tools that solve a wide variety of issues affecting PC games."
msgstr ""

#: src/tabs/about.cpp:72
msgid "Among its main features are a latency-free borderless window mode, HDR retrofit for SDR games, Nvidia Reflex in unsupported games, as well as texture modding for players and modders alike. While not all features are supported in all games, most DirectX 11 and 12 titles can make use of one or more of its features."
